&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus skills &amp;amp; attributes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling and ETL pipelines (esp dbt)&lt;/li&gt;
